/*
    Aria uses its own in-app translation table (see Localization.swift) for all
    of its own views. These bundles exist so AppKit knows the app supports
    Simplified Chinese: without a zh-Hans.lproj, macOS resolves the app to
    English only and every system-provided surface — the standard main-menu
    items, NSOpenPanel buttons and labels, NSAlert buttons — stays in English
    even on a Chinese system.
*/
